\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. COME, Holy Ghost, our souls inspire,
\par And lighten with celestial fire;
\par Thou the annointing Spirit art,
\par Who dost Thy sevenfold gifts impart:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy blessed unction from above
\par Is comfort, life, and fire of love;
\par Enable with perpetual light
\par The dullness of our blinded sight:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Anoint and cheer our soiled face
\par With the abundance of Thy grace:
\par Keep far our foes, give peace at home;
\par Where Thou art Guide no ill can come.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Teach us to know the Father, Son,
\par And Thee, of both, to be but one;
\par That through the ages all along
\par This, this may be our endless song:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par All praise to Thy eternal merit,
\par O Father, Son, and Holy Spirit!
\par \i0                           Amen.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

